# Cursor Adapter
All active agent roles are located in `.ai/rules/`.
LLM routing profiles are in `.ai/agents-config.md`. Switch the IDE model selector to the bound profile before launching a role.
All project engineering standards are located in `.ai/guidelines/engineering-standards.md`.
Always look up these directories before executing tasks.
Auto-discover the project environment manifest titled `Local Project Environment & Commands` under `docs/` (fallback: repository root). Never hardcode build or test commands.
